5 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVI.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Sancti Sperati vel comitum ejus martyrum.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IX  <HI REND="ITALIC">lect.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">f</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XV.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Aciscli et Victorie Martyrum.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IX  <HI REND="ITALIC">lect.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">g</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIIII.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Octava sancti Martini.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IIII  <HI REND="ITALIC">capp.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Romani monachi martyris.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IIII  <HI REND="ITALIC">capp.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><COL N="0103B"></COL> VI.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">A</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIII.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Elisabeth de Ungaria.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI  <HI REND="ITALIC">capp.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">b</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XII.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Odonis abbatis.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IX  <HI REND="ITALIC">lect.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIIII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">c</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XI.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Presentationis virginis Marie.</C> <C N=5 INDENT=475 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">VI  <HI REND="ITALIC">capp.</HI></C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">d</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">X.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Cecilie virginis et m