a Francisco de Pisa editum, in quo  <HI REND="ITALIC">Constantinae,</HI> 
id est, Cirtae in Numidia, aut passi, aut sepulti
perhibentur.</NOTE>  Sanctorum quadraginta martyrum.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">X.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">IV. Sanctae <NOTE N="b" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1051" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1051D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Serenae.</HI>  Hanc e citato fragmento Pisano habemus.</NOTE>  Serenae virg. mart.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XI.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">III.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Pr. Id.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Idibus.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIV.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIX. Kal. Feb. sancti Felicis Nolani.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XV.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVIII.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVI.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVII.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVI. Policarpi et Antonii.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XVIII.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XV.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><COL N="1051C"></COL> XIX.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIV. Sebastiani et comitum. mar.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XX.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XIII. <NOTE N="c" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1051" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1051D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Luciani.</HI>  Hunc hac die signavi, Missale nostrum
secutus.</NOTE>  Luciani presbiteri. mar.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XXI.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">XII <NOTE N="d" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="1051" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1051D"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Agnetis.</HI>  Orationale Gothicum et fragmentum
